F1Help 0.5 for Windows 95 and NT and Win32s.
 
F1Help is the application to generate windows help files,
HtmlHelp or html from any Delphi source file. It is handy
for component writers that want to document their components
and source code with an integrated help in the Delphi
environment and don't want to struggle with several different
environments to document their sources. F1Help is also able to
generate HTML documentation so complete description of all
library functions may be published on a web site.

